'g1': GLOBAL is for a level 01 entry in the FILE or WORKING-STORAGE SECTION (X3.23-1985 X-24, GLOBAL syntax rule 1)
'g2': GLOBAL is for a level 01 entry in the FILE or WORKING-STORAGE SECTION (X3.23-1985 X-24, GLOBAL syntax rule 1)
an entry with GLOBAL needs a data-name, not FILLER (X3.23-1985 X-21, data description entry syntax rule 5)
'g3' names two GLOBAL items in this DATA DIVISION (X3.23-1985 X-24, GLOBAL syntax rule 2)
'g4': GLOBAL is for a level 01 entry in the FILE or WORKING-STORAGE SECTION (X3.23-1985 X-24, GLOBAL syntax rule 1)
